      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think that wonder.fragment and Bazel target definitions for wonder driver should live in common-modules/wonder project. Only the symbol list for wonder should be added to GKI, since wonder driver is essentially a vendor module in this case.",
      "revId": "f2d8540645ba68afafc440508fbd8775dc521b9d",
