      "message": "The rule names you have added are implicitly aarch64 specific. This would mean different and confusing naming if we have to do x86_64 as well, or renaming the existing names later. I don\u0027t think it\u0027s OK.",
      "parentUuid": "de3fed0c_d2ecc2c3",
